OL,3,GNEWSASuspended sentence for painter
OL,4,Aafter stepson dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA painter and decorator was given a
OL,7,Fsuspended prison sentence after his
OL,8,Fstepson was fatally electrocuted while
OL,9,Fworking with him.
OL,11,FConnor Lambert, 24, died while moving a
OL,12,Fladder close to overhead power lines in
OL,13,FFarndon, Cheshire, the Health and
OL,14,FSafety Executive (HSE) said.
OL,16,FThe trainee painter from Market Drayton
OL,17,Fin Shropshire had been moving the
OL,18,Fladder close to the gable end of a
OL,19,Fhouse and it either came into contact
OL,20,Fwith the cables or came very close,
OL,21,Fcausing electricity to arc from the
OL,22,Fline.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
