OL,3,GNEWSASuspended sentence for painter
OL,4,Aafter stepson dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaniel Watton, 50, from Wollerton,
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to breaching health and
OL,8,Fsafety regulations by failing to
OL,9,Fproperly plan for the work. He was
OL,10,Fgiven 16 weeks imprisonment, suspended
OL,11,Ffor 12 months.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
